      "text": "FIG. 14. Convergence factor for P and Q at the boundaries of the black hole exterior for the numerical simulation with Q0 = 1.0, eQ0 = 0.6, and ω˜ = 0.0. The idealized value C = 4 is shown as a black dashed line in each panel.",
